Metadata in this catalog (STAC JSON files and items.parquet) written by the catalog maintainer
is dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

This catalog does NOT contain or redistribute the indexed data files. Every data asset links to
its upstream publisher, whose license applies (see each Collection's `license`,
`bim:license_quote` and `bim:attribution`).

Thumbnails (thumbnail.png) are derived from source data whose license permits derivatives
(bim:license_tier = "open") and are distributed under that same source license, with the
attribution given in the corresponding Item.
